[en.FOCUS_C12_IGNITE_THE_INNER_FURY]
Ignite the Inner Fury

[en.FOCUS_C12_IGNITE_THE_INNER_FURY_desc]
Every pony family on the rock farm suffered countless hardships during the Last Roundup—not just our Pie family. Unfortunately, my sister, Maud Pie, has always tried to downplay this so that the ponies might forget the past. Now, every pony should reignite the fire within their hearts and be ready to demand that the empire repay its blood debt in blood.

[zh.FOCUS_C12_IGNITE_THE_INNER_FURY]
点燃心中烈焰

[zh.FOCUS_C12_IGNITE_THE_INNER_FURY_desc]
采石农场的每个小马家庭都在终末之战遭到了无数苦难，而不仅仅是我们派家族，可惜我的妹妹石灰派一直在努力淡化这一点来让小马们忘记过往，现在，每个小马都该重新燃起心中的火焰，并准备好要帝国血债血偿。

